      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "The `ciWorkflows` resource represents an Xcode Cloud workflow. Use it to:",
          "refs": []
        },
        {
          "text": "To learn more about workflows, see `Xcode-Cloud-Workflow-Reference`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/Xcode/Xcode-Cloud-Workflow-Reference"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "> **Important**\n>\n>  Deleting a workflow also deletes associated build information and artifacts. Instead of deleting a workflow, consider deactivating it in Xcode or App Store Connect. To learn more about deactivating a workflow, see `Developing-a-Workflow-Strategy-for-Xcode-Cloud`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.documentation/documentation/Xcode/Developing-a-Workflow-Strategy-for-Xcode-Cloud"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This resource supports JSON web tokens with a lifetime of up to six months. For more information, see `generating-tokens-for-api-requests#Determine-the-Appropriate-Token-Lifetime`.",
          "refs": [
            "doc://com.apple.appstoreconnectapi/documentation/AppStoreConnectAPI/generating-tokens-for-api-requests#Determine-the-Appropriate-Token-Lifetime"
          ]
        }
      ],
